{"ts": "2026-09-14T02:22:36.864284+00:00", "run_id": "01a09db9-0f54-7005-95ad-8de5a9b1d531", "type": "answer", "seq": 109, "payload": {"summary": "**No—that is no longer true.** Medicare removed the \"three injections per day\" requirement in 2023. As of April 16, 2023, Medicare's updated criteria removed the language requiring beneficiaries to be \"insulin-treated with multiple (three or more) daily administrations\" to qualify for a CGM. Current Medicare coverage standards generally require only that you: - Been diagnosed with diabetes, **and** - Are treated with insulin (any insulin regimen, including fewer than three injections or a pump), **or** - Have a documented history of \"problematic hypoglycemia\" (recurrent severe low blood sugars) even if not on insulin. **Sources:** - Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (LCD L33822): [cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822](https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822) - American Diabetes Association webinar on 2023 Medicare changes: [youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA) - Dexcom summary of ex", "body_markdown": "**No—that is no longer true.** Medicare removed the \"three injections per day\" requirement in 2023.\n\nAs of April 16, 2023, Medicare's updated criteria removed the language requiring beneficiaries to be \"insulin-treated with multiple (three or more) daily administrations\" to qualify for a CGM. Current Medicare coverage standards generally require only that you:\n\n- Been diagnosed with diabetes, **and**\n- Are treated with insulin (any insulin regimen, including fewer than three injections or a pump), **or** \n- Have a documented history of \"problematic hypoglycemia\" (recurrent severe low blood sugars) even if not on insulin.\n\n**Sources:**\n- Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (LCD L33822): [cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822](https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822)\n- American Diabetes Association webinar on 2023 Medicare changes: [youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA)\n- Dexcom summary of expanded coverage: [dexcom.com/en-us/all-access/clinical-corner/medicare-coverage-expands](https://www.dexcom.com/en-us/all-access/clinical-corner/medicare-coverage-expands)", "claims": [], "citations": [{"n": 1, "evidence_id": "", "doc_id": "", "url": "https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822", "label": "https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?lcdid=33822"}, {"n": 2, "evidence_id": "", "doc_id": "", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA", "label": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GZ2mEZtG7UA"}, {"n": 3, "evidence_id": "", "doc_id": "", "url": "https://www.dexcom.com/en-us/all-access/clinical-corner/medicare-coverage-expands", "label": "https://www.dexcom.com/en-us/all-access/clinical-corner/medicare-coverage-expands"}], "effective_dates": [], "contradictions": [], "unknowns": [], "confidence": 0.0, "scope_warning": null}}
